### GET request to example server
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles

### GET request to obtain vehicles by color and year
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles/color/puce/year/2012

### GET request to obtain vehicles by brand and years
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles/brand/bentley/between/1995/2012

### GET request to obtain average speed by brand
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles/average_speed/brand/bentley

### GET request to obtain vehicles by fuel type
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles/fuel_type/gasoline

### GET request to obtain average capacity by brand
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles/average_capacity/brand/bentley

### GET request to obtain vehicles by transmission
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles/transmission/automatic

### GET request to obtain vehicles by dimesions
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles/dimensions?length=0-500&width=0-500

### GET request to obtain vehicles by weight
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles/weight?min=160&max=200

### POST request to create a new vehicle
POST http://localhost:8080/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 103,
  "brand": "Bentley",
  "model": "Continental GT",
  "registration": "ABC123",
  "color": "Puce",
  "year": 2012,
  "passengers": 5,
  "max_speed": 300,
  "fuel_type": "Gasoline",
  "transmission": "Automatic",
  "weight":150,
  "height": 52.78,
  "length": 47.63,
  "width": 46.63
}

### POST request to create a vehicles list
POST http://localhost:8080/vehicles/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "id": 104,
    "brand": "Bentley",
    "model": "Continental GT",
    "registration": "ABC123",
    "color": "Puce",
    "year": 2012,
    "passengers": 5,
