### PATCH request to update the max speed of a vehicle
PATCH http://localhost:8080/vehicles/1/update_speed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "max_speed": 350
}

### PUT request to update the fuel type of a vehicle
PUT http://localhost:8080/vehicles/1/update_fuel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fuel_type": "diesel"
}

### DELETE request to delete a vehicle
DELETE http://localhost:8080/vehicles/1
